&lt;li&gt;&lt;a class="link" href="https://www.microsoft.com/research/project/drawbridge/" target="_blank" rel="noopener"
 &gt;Drawbridge: Portable Library OS&lt;/a&gt; (MS의 선행 연구)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>